    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across the endless dunes in SANDSPEED: CAMEL RACING, an action camel racing game where speed and skill determine the champion! Compete in high-speed races and challenging time trials, push your camel to the limit as you dash through desertic landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play SANDSPEED:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's not about horsepower, It's about camelpower:</strong> Compete against swift rivals or test your reflexes in time-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet &quot;Super&quot; Sweet Watermelons:</strong> Snag juicy speed boosts by collecting watermelons on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Desert:</strong> Dodge hazards and conquer shifting terrain to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Thrill:</strong> Experience immersive desert-themed music and realistic racing sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Explore:</strong> Earn achievements, unlock new tracks, and uncover hidden surprises as you climb the tournament.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the dunes and become the ultimate camel racing champion? The race is on!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race across the endless dunes in SANDSPEED: CAMEL RACING, an action camel racing game where speed and skill determine the champion! Compete in high-speed races and challenging time trials, push your camel to the limit as you dash through desertic landscapes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play SANDSPEED:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's not about horsepower, It's about camelpower:</strong> Compete against swift rivals or test your reflexes in time-based challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweet &quot;Super&quot; Sweet Watermelons:</strong> Snag juicy speed boosts by collecting watermelons on the track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Desert:</strong> Dodge hazards and conquer shifting terrain to stay ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feel the Thrill:</strong> Experience immersive desert-themed music and realistic racing sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock &amp; Explore:</strong> Earn achievements, unlock new tracks, and uncover hidden surprises as you climb the tournament.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to dominate the dunes and become the ultimate camel racing champion? The race is on!</p>",
    "short_description": "Forget SUPERCARS, this is how real legends race! Dash through endless dunes, Outrun your rivals, and gobble up power-ups to stay in the lead. It's wild, it's fast, Do you have what it takes to become the ultimate Egyptian champion?",
